    "poster_id": 652,
    "post_rendered": "Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0c791effec928051d6aa14df3ee13b759e2ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ f: \\mathbb R\\longrightarrow \\mathbb R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" > such that for each <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31aaf23b2f7d955f6ebed6b4987671f25c60c578.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ x,y\\in\\mathbb R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" >:</span><br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/03277fb7256f4679ddb36b8685ecd7fa4ed8f5ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ f(xf(y)) + y + f(x) = f(x + f(y)) + yf(x)\\]\"  width=\"341\" height=\"18\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Find all functions $ f: \\mathbb R\\longrightarrow \\mathbb R$ such that for each $ x,y\\in\\mathbb R$:\r\n\\[ f(xf(y)) \\plus{} y \\plus{} f(x) \\equal{} f(x \\plus{} f(y)) \\plus{} yf(x)\\]",
